# Hex-Rays plugin decompilation dumps land here.
#
# Layout convention (mirrors references/ida/):
#   references/hexrays/<plugin>/<ida-version>/all/      — per-function .c files
#   references/hexrays/<plugin>/<ida-version>/all_funcs.txt
#   references/hexrays/<plugin>/<ida-version>/failed_addrs.txt
#
# Source binaries live in /hexrays/<ida-version>/<plugin>.so.
